{"sha": "2dcc99f6678eba81d609733af0a33c0861765f1bd903a730fb193047a471a6c3", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:potential-wells-tunneling} 章 --- 势阱、势垒与隧道效应}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:1}", "\\qty{1}{nm}: \\qty{0.38}{}, \\qty{1.50}{}, \\qty{3.38}{eV}; $2 \\to 1$: \\qty{1.13}{eV}, \\qty{1.1}{\\micro m}.", "\\qty{0.1}{nm}：\\qty{38}{eV}。核子：\\qty{8}{MeV}。弹珠：$E_1 = \\qty{5.5e-63}{J}$；", "$n = 2mvL/h = 3 \\times 10^{27}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:2}", "约束能 $\\qty{3.76}{eV.nm^2}/L^2$：$0.10$，$0.24$，$0.42$，\\qty{0.60}{eV}；总能量", "$1.84$, $1.98$, $2.16$, \\qty{2.34}{eV}: \\qty{673}{}, \\qty{628}{}, \\qty{574}{}, \\qty{530}{nm} ---", "红、橙、黄绿、绿。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:3}", "$\\kappa = \\qty{1.09e10}{m^{-1}}$; $\\eu^{-2\\kappa a}$: $1.5 \\times 10^{-3}$, $1.8 \\times 10^{-5}$,", "$3 \\times 10^{-10}$，$10^{-19}$；$\\times 8.8$（每 \\qty{0.1}{nm}）；质子：$\\kappa$ 大", "$43$ 倍，\\qty{0.3}{nm} 处为 $\\eu^{-280}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:4}", "$k_1 = \\qty{7.3e9}{m^{-1}}$，$k_2 = \\qty{5.1e9}{m^{-1}}$；$R = 0.03$，$T = 0.97$。台阶", "向下：$k_2 = \\qty{8.9e9}{m^{-1}}$，$R = 0.01$。经典粒子在有能量时", "从不折回；光波", "在任何折射率变化处都会部分反射。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:5}", "(a)、(b) 见\\cref{prop:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:infinite}。(c) $L/2$；", "$0.18L$；$0$；$\\pi\\hbar/L$；乘积 $0.57\\hbar > \\hbar/2$。(d) 快速", "振荡，围绕平均值 $1/L$ --- 即经典的均匀密度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:6}", "(a) 见\\cref{prop:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:finite}。(b) $1$，$3$，$7$。", "(c) $R = 2.6$，两个态；$\\kappa = \\qty{4.4e9}{m^{-1}}$，深度 \\qty{0.23}{nm}。(d)", "无穷多个，从下方趋于无限深势阱的情形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:7}", "(a) $1 + r = t$，$\\iu k(1 - r) = -\\kappa t$。(b) 分子与分母", "互为共轭；相位 $-2\\arctan(\\kappa/k)$。(c) 对实指数函数，$\\psi^*\\psi'$ 为", "实数。(d) \\qty{0.2}{nm}；与全反射的倏逝波相似：", "存在，不携带通量，并且能够向第二种介质提供能量", "--- 这就是隧道效应。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:8}", "(a) 见\\cref{thm:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:tunnel}。(b) $\\kappa a = 3$：", "精确值 $1/(1 + \\sinh^23) = 9.9 \\times 10^{-3}$，近似值 $4\\eu^{-6} = 9.9 \\times", "10^{-3}$；$\\kappa a = 1$：$0.42$ 对 $0.54$。(c) $\\kappa \\to \\iu k_2$；$T = 1$，", "条件为 $k_2a = n\\pi$。(d) 两个界面的反射在", "势垒宽度恰为半波长的整数倍时相互抵消 --- 共振", "透射。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:9}", "(a) $b = \\qty{52}{fm}$; $G = 82$; $T = \\eu^{-82} \\approx 2 \\times 10^{-36}$. (b) $v =", "\\qty{1.55e7}{m/s}$，每秒 $10^{21}$ 次撞击：速率 $2 \\times 10^{-15}\\,\\unit{s^{-1}}$，", "寿命 $\\sim 10^7$ 年。(c) $G = 100$ 与 $69$：$\\eu^{18} \\approx 10^8$ 倍更长，", "$\\eu^{-13} \\approx 10^{-6}$ 倍更短。(d) $\\alpha$ 粒子束缚很紧，并", "以正能量逸出；质子则不能；$^{12}$C 的电荷是其三倍，", "指数也远大得多（团簇衰变确实存在，约为 $10^{-10}$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:10}", "(a) \\qty{24}{GHz}; \\qty{41}{ps}. (b) $\\psi = (\\varphi_+\\eu^{-\\iu E_+t/\\hbar} +", "\\varphi_-\\eu^{-\\iu E_-t/\\hbar})/\\sqrt2$; $P = \\sin^2(\\pi\\nu t)$. (c) $\\eu^{(\\sqrt2 - 1)", "\\kappa a} = 15$：$\\kappa a = 6.5$。(d) 较重的基团与较高的势垒使", "隧道效应的周期长于数年。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:11}", "(a) \\qty{1.09e10}{m^{-1}}；$\\times 8.8$；$1\\%$ 的 $I$ 对应 \\qty{0.5}{pm}。(b) $6 \\times 10^9$。", "(c) 每个相邻原子位于 $d' = \\qty{0.56}{nm}$ 处，携带的电流为针尖电流的 $\\eu^{-2\\kappa \\times 0.06\\,\\text{nm}}", "= 0.28$；针尖本身约携带一半。(d)", "$10^{-5}\\,\\unit{K}$ --- 不可能；针尖与样品同步膨胀的对称设计，", "快速扫描、低膨胀材料，以及反馈。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:12}", "(a) \\qty{0.056}{} 与 \\qty{0.008}{eV}。(b) \\qty{1.48}{eV}，\\qty{835}{nm}。(c) 约束能", "\\qty{0.17}{eV}：$L = \\qty{6.1}{nm}$。(d) $R = 3.6$：三个。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\kappa = \\sqrt{2m\\Phi}/\\hbar = \\qty{1.09e10}{m^{-1}}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\eu^{2.2} = 8.8$；$\\eu^{0.022}$：每皮米 $2.2\\%$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} \\qty{0.5}{pm}.", "", "\\textbf{4.} 每秒 $6 \\times 10^9$ 个；相隔 \\qty{0.16}{ns}，而 $\\hbar/\\Phi", "\\sim 10^{-16}\\,\\unit{s}$：一次一个。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 约一半；其余电流随距离衰减得如此之快，以至于", "所成的像是单个原子的。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\times 8.8$；恒定电流使针尖安全，并将", "指数关系转化为线性的高度。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\Delta T = 10^{-12}/(10^{-5} \\times 0.02) = \\qty{5e-6}{K}$；对称的", "安装方式、扫描速度、低膨胀材料，以及能够跟随", "漂移的反馈。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 梯形势垒，在收集一侧降低：有效", "势垒变薄，$I$ 的增长快于线性。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\kappa' = \\qty{0.89e10}{m^{-1}}$；在 \\qty{0.5}{nm} 处，指数由", "$10.9$ 降至 $8.9$，$I \\times 7$：针尖回缩 $\\ln 7/2\\kappa' \\approx \\qty{0.1}{nm}$", "--- 这是一个电子效应引起的凸起，而非几何起伏。", ""]}